---

<Layout
	path="/it/"
	title="Bussola Online — Navigazione Geodetica, Livella a Bolla & Tachimetro GPS"
	description="Bussola digitale online gratuita ad alta precisione con nord vero e magnetico, declinazione WMM, livella a bolla, tachimetro GPS e cercatore Qibla."
	keywords="bussola online, bussola digitale gratis, nord vero vs magnetico, declinazione magnetica, livella a bolla online, tachimetro gps online, calcolo rilevamento, direzione qibla"
>
	<!-- ─── Hero Section ───────────────────────────────────── -->
	<section id="compass" class="relative overflow-hidden">
		<div class="mesh-gradient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
		<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 pt-12 pb-16 text-center sm:px-6 md:pt-20 md:pb-24">
			<Compass />
			<div class="mx-auto mt-10 max-w-3xl md:mt-14">
				<div class="badge mx-auto">nel browser · zero installazione · privata e pronta offline</div>

				<h1 class="mx-auto mt-6 max-w-4xl text-[34px] leading-[40px] font-bold text-ink sm:text-display-xl md:text-[54px] md:leading-[60px]">
					Navigazione Geodetica & Orientamento di Precisione nel Browser.
				</h1>

				<p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-body">
					Rilevamento in tempo reale con declinazione magnetica automatica WMM, telemetria GPS, azimut Qibla ed effemeridi solari e lunari. Senza download, senza tracciamento e con architettura PWA offline.
				</p>

				<div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
					<a href="#engineering" class="btn-primary">Architettura dei Sensori</a>
					<a href="/it/compass/" class="btn-secondary">Apri Bussola a Schermo Intero</a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ─── Feature Highlights Strip ───────────────────────── -->
	<section class="border-y border-hairline bg-canvas">
		<div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] grid-cols-1 gap-px overflow-hidden px-4 py-12 sm:grid-cols-3 sm:px-6">
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">nord vero vs magnetico</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Declinazione in tempo reale calcolata tramite il World Magnetic Model (WMM) NOAA/BGS per far coincidere la rotta con le carte topografiche in qualsiasi punto del globo.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">100% privacy sul dispositivo</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Tutta la fusione dei sensori, la calibrazione del magnetometro e la trigonometria geodetica girano in locale nel motore JavaScript. Nessun account né tracciamento server.
				</p>
			</div>
			<div class="p-4">
				<p class="eyebrow mb-2">pwa pronta all'uso offline</p>
				<p class="text-sm text-body leading-6">
					Si installa direttamente nella schermata iniziale grazie al Service Worker. Bussola, inclinometro e calcolatori continuano a funzionare anche senza campo cellulare.
				</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<!-- ─── Complete Navigation Toolkit Grid (All 8 Tools) ─── -->
	<section id="tools" class="scroll-mt-16">
		<div class="mx-auto max-w-[1200px] px-4 py-20 sm:px-6 md:py-28">
			<p class="eyebrow">la suite di navigazione completa</p>
			<h2 class="mt-3 max-w-3xl text-display-lg text-ink">
				Otto Strumenti Geodetici Dedicati. Un'Unica Piattaforma.
			</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 max-w-2xl text-body-lg text-body">
				Ogni utilità è ottimizzata per l'esecuzione immediata nel browser, senza dipendenze da server esterni, con latenza minima ed esattezza matematica professionale.
			</p>

			<div class="mt-12 grid gap-6 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4">
				<!-- Tool 1: Digital Compass -->
				<a href="/it/compass/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
									<polygon points="12 4 15 12 12 20 9 12" fill="currentColor"></polygon>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">bussola</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Bussola Digitale</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Quadrante interattivo a 360° con ago fluido, visualizzazione dei gradi in tempo reale, 16 punti cardinali, compensazione dell'inclinazione e tasto nord vero.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Apri bussola →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 2: Bubble Level / Inclinometer -->
				<a href="/it/level/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle>
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" fill="currentColor"></circle>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">inclinometro</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Livella a Bolla</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Livella circolare a occhio di bue e fiale tubolari per misurare beccheggio, rollio, angolo composito e pendenza in percentuale con azzeramento relativo e feedback aptico.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Apri livella →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 3: GPS Speedometer & Altimeter -->
				<a href="/it/speedometer/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M4.93 4.93l2.83 2.83M16.24 16.24l2.83 2.83M2 12h4M18 12h4M4.93 19.07l2.83-2.83M16.24 7.76l2.83-2.83"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">velocità e alt</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Tachimetro GPS</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Rilevamento cinematico della velocità mediante effetto Doppler satellitare con scelta unità (km/h, mph, nodi, m/s), quota ellissoidica WGS84 e contachilometri parziale.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Apri tachimetro →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 4: Coordinate Converter & Bearing Calculator -->
				<a href="/it/bearing/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<line x1="2" y1="12" x2="22" y2="12"></line>
									<polyline points="12 2 22 12 12 22"></polyline>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">navigazione</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Rotta e Rilevamento</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Calcolo di azimut ortodromico, rotta inversa e distanza di Haversine con convertitore universale di coordinate tra Gradi Decimali, DMS, UTM e Plus Codes.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Calcola rotta →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 5: GPS Location & Telemetry -->
				<a href="/it/location/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
									<path d="M12 2v3M12 19v3M2 12h3M19 12h3"></path>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">posizione</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Coordinate GPS</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Latitudine, longitudine geodetica di precisione, altitudine sul livello del mare e raggio di incertezza orizzontale con copia immediata e instradamento su mappe.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Vedi coordinate →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 6: Direction to Makkah (Qibla) -->
				<a href="/it/qibla/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect>
									<line x1="12" y1="4" x2="12" y2="20"></line>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">qibla</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Direzione per La Mecca</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Azimut ortodromico di cerchio massimo verso la Kaaba alla Mecca con distanza geodetica in chilometri e miglia nautiche, e guida visiva sul quadrante.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Trova Qibla →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 7: Solar Position & Sun Compass -->
				<a href="/it/sun/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
					<div>
						<div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-3">
							<span class="inline-flex h-9 w-9 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-hairline bg-canvas-soft text-ink group-hover:border-ink transition-colors">
								<svg class="h-5 w-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8">
									<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="5"></circle>
									<line x1="12" y1="1" x2="12" y2="3"></line>
									<line x1="12" y1="21" x2="12" y2="23"></line>
									<line x1="4.22" y1="4.22" x2="5.64" y2="5.64"></line>
									<line x1="18.36" y1="18.36" x2="19.78" y2="19.78"></line>
									<line x1="1" y1="12" x2="3" y2="12"></line>
									<line x1="21" y1="12" x2="23" y2="12"></line>
								</svg>
							</span>
							<span class="eyebrow">astronomia</span>
						</div>
						<h3 class="text-display-sm text-ink group-hover:text-link transition-colors">Posizione del Sole</h3>
						<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-body leading-5">
							Azimut solare in tempo reale, angolo di elevazione, orari di alba e tramonto e mezzogiorno solare per fotografia e allineamento di impianti fotovoltaici.
						</p>
					</div>
					<span class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-link group-hover:underline">Guarda posizione sole →</span>
				</a>

				<!-- Tool 8: Sun & Moon Direction Overlay -->
				<a href="/it/sun-moon/" class="card-lg group p-6 transition-shadow hover:shadow-modal flex flex-col justify-between">
